//    HoT by 2 s (10 s); channel all of it. Convoke the Spirits often, a Wild Growth and Rejuvenations out first, in caster form. Incarnation: Tree
//    of Life 10-12 s before the damage, paired with Tranquility. Nature's Swiftness on Regrowth; with the tier set's 4 pieces it grants Genesis,
